rong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 hand sculpted monsters to collect and battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 unique passive items to aid you on your runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique environments to explore, each with their own monsters and battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 15 unique bosses to battle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frequent new content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine a monster battle game where new monsters are CONSTANTLY being added! Our goal is to push out new monsters monthly so that you always have exciting new content to look forward to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Badge Scout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062680/53f7a0a0adb720fdbaf07edf71593befbe858144.jpg"},{"name":"Beast Tamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062680/99f438633dbf5919988186c59f460d6744687e73.jpg"},{"name":"Concept Art","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062680/c8a6ceaf110b289740c504d1cd757446e4b6388d.jpg"},{"name":"Shogunaka","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062680/959949e63ec38c2e82a48666468b1886e07a9c88.jpg"},{"name":"Power Hitter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062680/9a76a04a8b2d3b3a853d945aa432078430b8d1c2.jpg"},{"name":"Foodie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062680/df7cb00bab5e0a51e9a70ac1020737c57327aba7.jpg"},{"name":"Spooky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062680/878c80063402e5a184cf1de14f0c88b60db9fc3f.jpg"},{"name":"Elemental","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/