na. In addition, each run features random monsters and a variety of zones players can enter, each with its own set of unique Sculplings to capture!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062680/extras/f42cae3ffcb884bb1b6c3802be546641.avif?t=1773009720\" width=600 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062680/extras/80e87b43a0c28a52952f30a4369ae002.poster.avif?t=1773009720\" width=480 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062680/extras/80e87b43a0c28a52952f30a4369ae002.webm?t=1773009720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062680/extras/80e87b43a0c28a52952f30a4369ae002.mp4?t=1773009720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculplings features <strong>over 100 unique, hand-sculpted monsters</strong> to discover and collect, each with their own strategies and playstyles. The trick is to discover which collection of Sculplings will give you the best chances of reaching the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062680/extras/340db843e1b83cb8b01b533ec47292bc.avif?t=1773009720\" width=600 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_p